{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次復二制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次復一制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "土羅遮重罪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "突吉羅者惡作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四事竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三事竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十事竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本云與私也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曇摩羅叉云，五種食者，󰉓、飯、魚、肉、煮\n麥飯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本七日者，皆言七時，無日字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯者解云：因緣食者，食已不囑，後飢，須當自求乞一鉢食，授與彼囑食比丘。比丘即\n或一口或五三口食已，還授與，得噉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本用柿\n藥著眼中物，不名匕也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本不言榻也，音似，名小床也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九十二事竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯者解云：四悔者，或言應說法、或言應發露者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四悔過竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本音不言器仗也，更有名，難轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾多七十四竟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0903006", "target": null, "type": "orig", "text": "〔元嘉年〕－【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0903006", "target": null, "type": "mod", "text": "元嘉年【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0540a18"}
